[7105]="7002FE76\n1\tHabla con Gandalf\tGandalf desea hablar contigo.\n2\tObserva el destino de los dos hobbits\tLos hobbits están en la Colina de Bárbol.\n3\tHabla con Gandalf\tGandalf está en la Colina de Bárbol.\n4\tEscucha a Gandalf\tGandalf está en la Colina de Bárbol.\n5\tHabla con Gandalf\tGandalf está en la Colina de Bárbol en Fangorn.\n",
[7106]="7006EEC1\n1\tMove to the main tent inside the camp Avoid Ekhamâti Look-outs\tMove to the main tent to determine who is leading this force of Ordâkhai.\n2\tListen to Nimasi in the tent.\t\n3\tListen to Bârshud's message to Mizâdi\tListen to Bârshud's message to Mizâdi.\n4\tFlee the tent and find Surâsh before Bârshud changes his mind\tFlee the tent and find Surâsh.\n5\tFree Surâsh near the front gate\tFree Surâsh near the front gate.\n",
[7107]="7004E1DF\n1\tTalk to King Thorin III Stonehelm\tKing Thorin III Stonehelm can be found before the gates of Erebor. Vethúg Wintermind makes for Erebor, and King Thorin III Stonehelm has readied an army of dwarves and Elves to oppose him. You should speak to King Thorin when you are prepared to defend Erebor.\n2\tFollow King Thorin III Stonehelm\tYou should follow King Thorin III Stonehelm and remain alert at the gates of Erebor.\n3\tTalk to King Thorin III Stonehelm\tKing Thorin III Stonehelm is making ready to defend Erebor. King Thorin III Stonehelm has spoken to the forces arrayed in defence of Erebor. You should now speak to King Thorin III Stonehelm.\n4\tDefend Erebor from Vethúg Wintermind and his brood\tVethúg Wintermind's brood has descended upon Erebor. Vethúg Wintermind has come to Erebor. You should aid the dwarves of Erebor in defending against the attacks of Vethúg's brood.\n5\tDefeat Vethúg Wintermind\tVethúg Wintermind has descended from the sky. Vethúg Wintermind is attacking Erebor. You should attempt to defeat him.\n6\tStruggle against the cold!\tThe cold has taken you.\n7\tTalk to King Thorin III Stonehelm\tKing Thorin III Stonehelm can be found before the gates of Erebor. You were incapacitated during the battle against Vethúg Wintermind, but have awoken to find King Thorin III Stonehelm standing triumphantly above you.\n",
[7108]="7006C79D\n1\tTalk to Girhâzi\tKhûldim Umûn has led you into a salt mine where he claims the Dubarâkh is hidden. You should talk to Girhâzi.\n2\tAccompany Girhâzi and Khûldim\tKhûldim Umûn has led you into a salt mine where he claims the Dubarâkh is hidden. You should follow Girhâzi and Khûldim.\n3\tDefend yourself from the attackers (total: 3)\tKhûldim Umûn has led you into a salt mine where he claims the Dubarâkh is hidden. You should follow Girhâzi and Khûldim.\n4\tEscucha la conversación\t\n5\tDefend yourself from the attackers (total: 5)\t\n6\tTalk to Girhâzi\t\n",
[7109]="7006AA3F\n1\tTalk to Belondor\tYou have arrived at the Iron Stairwell in Mâkhda Khorbo, where you and Belondor faced each other as enemies, and where his crew was slain by Azagath's dark magic. You should talk to Belondor.\n2\tTalk to Belondor\tYou have arrived at the Iron Stairway in Mâkhda Khorbo, where you and Belondor faced each other as enemies, and where his crew was slain by Azagath's dark magic. You should talk to Belondor.\n3\tTalk to Belondor\tYou have arrived at the Iron Stairway in Mâkhda Khorbo, where you and Belondor faced each other as enemies, and where his crew was slain by Azagath's dark magic. You should talk to Belondor.\n4\tAscend the Iron Stairwell\tWithin Mâkhda Khorbo, Belondor has noticed that the gate previously blocking access to the stairs is now open. You should go up the stairs.\n5\tTalk to Belondor\tYou have followed Belondor into an upstairs area. You should talk to Belondor.\n6\tDefeat Ghâbekhid (total: 8)\tAs you enter this upstairs area, you discover that it is infested with bats. You should defeat bats.\n7\tContinue searching the area\tYou are in an area of Mâkhda Khorbo that Belondor says he saw Azagath and Nakási enter. You should search the area for signs of why they may have come here.\n8\tExamine the item\tYou and Belondor have spotted something at the end of this hallway. You should investigate what it is.\n9\tExamine the map\tAt the end of a hallway in Mâkhda Khorbo you and Belondor have found a tapestry on the wall that is a map. You should examine the map.\n10\tTalk to Belondor\tYou have searched Mâkhda Khorbo and found the remains of a map, torn in half. You should talk to Belondor.\n",
[7110]="70037DBE\n1\tTalk to Gimli in the Glittering Caves\tGimli is in the Glittering Caves, ready to proceed further into Aglarond.\n2\tTalk to the Rohirrim child\tYou have encountered a small child in the Glittering Caves.\n3\tLearn what evil has entered the Glittering Caves\tSome villainy has come to the Glittering Caves of Aglarond.\n4\tHabla con Lheu Brenin\tLheu Brenin and other members of the Falcon Clan have come to the Glittering Caves.\n5\tHabla con Gimli\tGimli is not sure what to make of Lheu Brenin.\n6\tSurvive the assault of the Falcon Clan warriors\tLheu Brenin has commanded his warriors to kill everyone in the Glittering Caves.\n7\tTalk to the child of the Westfold\tThe child of the Westfold has excitedly asked for you to speak to her.\n8\tHabla con Lheu Brenin\tLheu Brenin is ready to fight, and has no fear of you or Gimli.\n9\tWeaken Lheu Brenin\tLheu Brenin has vast reserves of strength, and wishes to see you dead. You have to weaken him through battle!\n10\tHabla con Lheu Brenin\tLheu Brenin has vast reserves of strength, and wishes to see you dead. You have to weaken him through battle!\n11\tWeaken Lheu Brenin\tLheu Brenin has vast reserves of strength, and wishes to see you dead. You have to weaken him through battle!\n12\tTalk to the child of the Westfold\tThe child of the Westfold has tried to get your attention.\n13\tDefeat Lheu Brenin\tLheu Brenin has come to the end of his strength, and has paid for his crimes.\n14\tTalk to Gimli in the Glittering Caves\030Talk to the child of the Westfold\tLheu Brenin has been defeated, and the people who shelter in the Glittering Caves are now safe from the Falcon Clan.\n",
[7111]="70028FAB\n1\tDescubre el origen de los suministros de los hombres de las Tierras Brunas\t\n2\tDerrota a los capitanes de suministros (total: 3)\tDerrota a los tres capitanes que vigilan los almacenes de suministros.\n",
[7112]="7006B596\n1\tTalk to Rahâzi\tRahâzi wants to go over the plan before you infiltrate the fortress above Jirush.\n2\tSneak into the fortress and search the right side of the Ordâkhai camp\tYour part of the plan requires you to sneak inside the fortress and turn to the right to search for the prisoner.\n3\tRemain on your guard and listen to the newcomer\tTatháta has come to the fortress above Jirush.\n4\tTalk to Tatháta\tTatháta has come to the fortress above Jirush.\n5\tTalk to Tatháta\tTatháta has come to the fortress above Jirush.\n6\tAsk Tatháta a single question\tTatháta has offered to answer a single question of yours.\n7\tListen to what Tatháta has to say\tTatháta has agreed to answer a single question of yours.\n8\tTalk to Tatháta\tTatháta has answered your question, and the sound of distant shouting has brought your conversation with her to a close.\n9\tLeave the fortress by the main gate before you are discovered by the Ordâkhai\tThe time has come for you to leave the fortress before you are discovered by the Ordâkhai.\n",
[7113]="70066D83\n1\tHabla con Cebadilla Mantecona\tCebadilla Mantecona se encuentra en el Poney Pisador.\n2\tInterpreta cantares marineros en la entrada del Poney Pisador (total: 3)\tCebadilla Mantecona te ha pedido que interpretes cantares marineros por todo el Poney Pisador.\n3\tInterpreta cantares marineros en la silla del barbero del Poney Pisador (total: 3)\tCebadilla Mantecona te ha pedido que interpretes cantares marineros por todo el Poney Pisador.\n4\tInterpreta cantares marineros en el escenario del Poney Pisador (total: 3)\tCebadilla Mantecona te ha pedido que interpretes cantares marineros por todo el Poney Pisador.\n5\tInterpreta cantares marineros en la chimenea trasera del Poney Pisador (total: 3)\tCebadilla Mantecona te ha pedido que interpretes cantares marineros por todo el Poney Pisador.\n6\tInterpreta cantares marineros en el centro del Poney Pisador ([según el diario]/3)\tCebadilla Mantecona te ha pedido que interpretes cantares marineros por todo el Poney Pisador.\n7\t¡Has sido groseramente [según el diario]!\tHas sido groseramente [según el diario] por dos hombres, Bill Helechal y Harry Goatleaf, que han irrumpido ruidosamente en el Poney Pisador. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n8\tEnfrenta a Bill Helechal\tBill Helechal está en el Poney Pisador.\n9\tEscucha a Cebadilla Mantecona\tCebadilla Mantecona confronta a Bill Helechal y Harry Goatleaf.\n10\tHabla con Cebadilla Mantecona\tCebadilla Mantecona se encuentra en el Poney Pisador.\n",
[7114]="7005339E\n1\tTalk to Tautila\tTautila can be found in the warrens of Tûn Melen. You have returned after nightfall as Tautila asked. You should speak to Tautila.\n2\tTalk to Vulfila\tVulfila can be found in the warrens of Tûn Melen. Tautila has been taken from his cage and Vulfila appears to have been waiting for you to return. You should confront Vulfila.\n3\tFind and rescue Tautila from Sharkey\tTautila can be found somewhere in the warrens of Tûn Melen. Sharkey has taken Tautila and plans to hang him as punishment. You should try to rescue Tautila from Sharkey.\n4\tFree Tautila\tTautila can be found deep within the warrens of Tûn Melen. You have found Tautila. You should loosen his restraints and free him.\n5\tTalk to Tautila\tTautila can be found deep within the warrens of Tûn Melen. You have found and freed Tautila, but he is unable to walk. You should talk to Tautila and try to help him to his feet.\n6\tConfront Sharkey\tSharkey is in the warrens of Tûn Melen. Sharkey has revealed himself. You should confront Sharkey.\n7\tTalk to Sharkey\tSharkey is in the warrens of Tûn Melen. After you defeated his guards, Sharkey has surrendered to you and Tautila. You should talk to Sharkey.\n8\tTalk to Tautila\tTautila can be found in the warrens of Tûn Melen. You have defeated Garmog. After he surrendered and bartered the true identity of Sharkey for his life, Garmog fled the warrens of Tûn Melen. You should talk to Tautila.\n",
[7115]="7003597C\n1\tHabla con Barbamusgo\tBarbamusgo se encuentra fuera de la futura ubicación del campamento de la Mano Blanca en el Bosque Funesto. Barbamusgo está preparado para contarte una parte de lo que los árboles le han dicho sobre los orígenes de Núrzum antes de regresar con Barallas y los demás.\n2\tEscucha mientras Barbamusgo narra la caída de Brúndoron\tLa historia de Barbamusgo aún se está desarrollando. Barbamusgo está compartiendo sus recuerdos tal como los aprendió de los árboles del Bosque Funesto. Debes escuchar mientras te cuenta más de esta historia.\n3\tHabla con Barbamusgo\tBarbamusgo se encuentra en la futura ubicación del campamento de la Mano Blanca en el Bosque Funesto. La historia de Barbamusgo ha llegado a su fin. Debes hablar con él antes de continuar tu viaje hacia Barallas y los demás.\n",
[7116]="70054720\n1\tTalk to Felgúr\tFelgúr smells someone coming. You should talk to Felgúr.\n2\tEscucha la conversación\tThe Pale Herald is coming. You should listen to the conversation.\n3\tEnter Torech Ungol\tFelgúr ran into Torech Ungol, followed by Rûkhor and the Ungoledain. You should enter Torech Ungol.\n4\tFind Felgúr\tFelgúr ran into Torech Ungol, followed by Rûkhor and the Ungoledain. You should find Felgúr.\n5\tBreak free of the webs!\tShelob is coming! You need to escape from the webs!\n6\tEscape Torech Ungol\tFelgúr was just devoured by Shelob. She is coming for you. Run!\n7\tHabla con Legolas.\tYou have escaped Shelob. You should talk to Legolas.\n",
[7117]="70030311\n1\tHabla con Elfmar\tElfmar está de pie frente a su Salón del Hidromiel y desea hablar contigo sobre la posibilidad de entrenar a sus hombres.\n2\tHabla con Elfmar para comenzar el entrenamiento\tElfmar desea entrenar contigo.\n3\tHabla con Horn\030Habla con Nona\tNona y Horn están en el campo frente al Salón del Hidromiel de Redilaldea.\n4\tLos hombres de Elfmar están en el campo frente al Salón del Hidromiel de Redilaldea. Elfmar te ha pedido que entrenes con sus hombres para que adquieran más experiencia en combate.\t\n5\tHabla con Elfmar\t¡Elfmar quiere tener otro combate contigo!\n6\tHabla con Corudan\tCorudan también desea entrenar contigo.\n7\tHabla con Elfmar\tElfmar está en el campo frente al Salón del Hidromiel de Redilaldea.\n",
[7118]="700375CA\n1\tTalk to Thane Ordlac\tThane Ordlac stands before the table where Reeve Fríthild lies. You should speak with Thane Ordlac before the funeral begins.\n2\tCollect Reeve Fríthild's shield\tFríthild's shield is on the table near the door. Thane Ordlac asked you to retrieve Fríthild's shield and place it upon her in state.\n3\tPlace Fríthild's shield upon her in state\tFríthild lies upon the table before the fireplace. Thane Ordlac asked you to retrieve Fríthild's shield and place it upon her in state.\n4\tWatch the funeral proceedings\tWatch the funeral proceedings.\n5\tTalk to Thane Ordlac\tThane Ordlac stands before the table where Reeve Fríthild lies. Thane Ordlac wishes for you to speak with him again.\n6\tCollect Reeve Fríthild's sword\tFríthild's sword is on the table near the door. Thane Ordlac asked you to retrieve Fríthild's sword and place it upon her in state.\n7\tPlace Reeve Fríthild's sword upon her in state\tFríthild lies upon the table before the fireplace. Thane Ordlac asked you to retrieve Fríthild's sword and place it upon her in state.\n8\tWatch the funeral proceedings\tWatch the funeral proceedings.\n9\tTalk to Thane Ordlac\tThane Ordlac stands before the table where Reeve Fríthild lies. Thane Ordlac wishes for you to speak with him again.\n10\tTalk to Fríthbert\030Habla con Edhild\tYoung Reeve Fríthbert and his sister Edhild appear distraught at Thane Ordlac's pronouncement. You should speak with them.\n11\tTalk to Dudsig\tDudsig is near the door to Reeve Fríthild's house. Dudsig wishes to speak with you.\n",
[7119]="7002EF53\n1\tHabla con Hestil fuera del campamento de los Uruks\tHestil está fuera del campamento de los Uruks en Amon Hen, esperando hablar contigo antes de poner el plan en marcha.\n2\tHabla con Maedal fuera del campamento de los Uruks\tMaedal está fuera del campamento de los Uruks en Amon Hen, esperando hablar contigo sobre tu parte del plan para rescatar a Drafli Escudoancho del cautiverio.\n3\tEscucha lo que ocurre dentro del campamento de los Uruks\tTienes que observar qué ocurre dentro del campamento de los Uruks en Amon Hen. ¡Ten cuidado de que no te vean! Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n4\tEntra en el campamento y derrota al Uruk que vigila la jaula de Drafli\t¡El campamento de los Uruks se ha vaciado casi por completo para perseguir a Isteron! Debes ir a rescatar a Drafli Escudoancho mientras los demás se ocupan del bienestar de Isteron.\n5\tHabla con Drafli Escudoancho\tDrafli Escudoancho está dentro de su jaula, en el campamento de los Uruks en Amon Hen. Tienes que hablar con él para ayudarlo a superar su abatimiento.\n6\tHabla con Drafli Escudoancho\tDrafli Escudoancho ha recuperado la confianza y necesita hablar contigo.\n7\tHabla con Isteron en la cima de Amon Hen\tIsteron está en peligro cerca de la cima de Amon Hen.\n8\tSobrevive a tu encuentro con el Sureño Sombrío\tEl grupo de aventureros a sueldo de Hestil está en peligro cerca de la cima de Amon Hen.\n9\tHabla con Ramdir en la cima de Amon Hen\tRamdir está cerca de la cima de Amon Hen y deberías hablar con él.\n",
[7120]="70028E15\n1\tDestruye los suministros (total: 5)\tBusca y destruye los depósitos de suministros en Brôntrig para distraer a los Hombres de las Tierras Brunas y evitar que adviertan el avance de los rohirrim.\n2\tQuema las chozas de los Hombres de las Tierras Brunas en Brôntrig (total: 3)\tQuema las chozas para distraer aún más a los Hombres de las Tierras Brunas.\n3\tHuye de Brôntrig\tTodo está perdido. Es hora de huir de Brôntrig.\n",
[7121]="7002BFC8\n1\tDerrota a todos los Khundolar Orientales del campamento.\t\n",
[7122]="70039718\n1\tTalk to Herefara\tThe enemy is preparing to assault Brockbridge with renewed vigour, and the few defenders remaining will be hard-pressed to keep the city secure.\n2\tDefend Brockbridge\tThe enemy will assault both of the barricaded entrances into Brockbridge. Herefara has asked you to use your war-steed and help the defenders that are more overwhelmed.\n3\tTalk to Herefara\tHerefara would like to thank you for your assistance in keeping the enemy at bay and ensuring not too many men were lost in the battle.\n",
[7123]="7006B714\n1\tTalk to Corudan inside Utug-bûr\tCorudan knows the need for haste if you are to rescue Sigileth.\n2\tHeed the words of Corudan\tYou can go no further inside Utug-bûr or you will be trapped forever with the Thardúth.\n3\tChoose your words with care and call for Sigileth to return to you\tYou can go no further without risking entombment with the Thardúth... but perhaps Sigileth will hear your voice if you call for her down the hallway!\n4\tEscape from Utug-bûr!\tYou are out of time! You must escape from Utug-bûr! Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n5\tDays pass, and a ruler in Umbar Baharbêl anxiously awaits news\tDays later, anxious eyes turn to the east and consider the army of soldiers approaching Umbar Baharbêl.\n6\tTalk to your brother Jajax in Dâr Laja and tell him what you saw\tJajax waits in Dâr Laja to hear news of what his brother Daxamat learned of the approaching army.\n7\tTalk to Hármelak inside Dâr Laja and tell her what you saw\tHármelak waits for tidings of the army that approaches the city, and your brother Jajax is not about to give her this news. It falls to you to do this, Daxamat.\n8\tDays earlier, in the aftermath of the Dagor Carlanthir\tSeveral days ago, in the aftermath of the Dagor Carlanthir.\n9\tBreak the rubble beside the collapsed entrance to Utug-bûr\tYou cannot have imagined it! You know someone lives beneath the rubble!\n10\tBreak more of the rubble beside the collapsed entrance to Utug-bûr\tYou cannot have imagined it! You know someone lives beneath the rubble!\n11\tTalk to Sigileth among the rubble beside the collapsed entrance to Utug-bûr\tYour quick action has unearthed Sigileth from the rubble that might have proved her tomb!\n",
[7124]="70042902\n1\tHabla con Bingo en las orillas del Brandivino\tBingo está listo para aprender a nadar, y necesita tu consejo.\n2\tHabla con Bingo en la orilla del Brandivino\tBingo está listo para aprender a nadar, y necesita tu consejo.\n3\tHabla con Bingo en la orilla del Brandivino\tBingo está listo para aprender a nadar, y necesita tu consejo.\n4\tNada al otro lado del río\tDar ejemplo quizás pueda ayudar. Si cruzas el río nadando, puede que Bingo encuentre la manera de hacer lo mismo.\n5\tVuelve con Bingo y comprueba si tu demostración ha sido de ayuda\tDeberías regresar con Bingo y ver si tu demostración le ha ayudado a ganar algo de confianza.\n6\tHabla con Bingo, pero que no te gotee encima\tBingo ha chapoteado un poco en el agua. Es posible que haya nadado un poco, pero es difícil decirlo a ciencia cierta.\n",
[7125]="7004148F\n1\tTalk to Roamingstar\tRoamingstar is standing on a small shoal along the Gilrain. You have agreed to aid Roamingstar in banishing the Ruthless Dead and should now speak to her.\n2\tFollow the river south towards the mere\tThe river Gilrain flows south from Roamingstar's glade. Roamingstar has asked you to follow the Gilrain south to the mere and prevent the Dead from crossing it.\n3\tDefeat the Ruthless Dead trying to cross the Gilrain\tThe Ruthless Dead are attacking from the western banks of the Gilrain. You have encountered the Ruthless Dead along the Gilrain and should prevent them from crossing.\n4\tFollow the Gilrain further south\tThe river Gilrain flows south from Roamingstar's glade. You have defeated the Ruthless Dead you encountered along the river's edge and should now continue south.\n5\tDefeat the Ruthless Dead before they can cross the Gilrain\tThe Ruthless Dead are attacking from the western banks of the Gilrain. The Ruthless Dead have renewed their attack, and must be defeated before they can cross the Gilrain unhindered.\n6\tFollow the Gilrain to the edge of the mere\tThe river Gilrain flows south to the mere from Roamingstar's glade. You have defeated the Ruthless Dead once more and should now meet Roamingstar at the edge of the mere.\n7\tConfront Nerzus and the Ruthless Dead\tNerzus and the Ruthless Host can be found on the western banks of the mere. You have encountered Nerzus and his grim host as they ready to cross into Lebennin.\n8\tTalk to Roamingstar\tRoamingstar can be found at the edge of the mere along the Gilrain in eastern Dor-en-Ernil. You have defeated the Ruthless Dead and driven them far from Dor-en-Ernil. You should now speak to Roamingstar.\n",
[7126]="70010044\n1\tLocaliza y detén a los angmarim antes de que obtengan la piel de Bregmor\tEncuentra la guarida del dragón Bregmor.\n2\tDerrota a Ythel\tDerrota al líder de las fuerzas angmarim.\n",
[7127]="700000D3\n1\tHabla con Dwalin\tAcompaña y defiende a Dwalin mientras avanzas hacia la tumba de Skorgrím.\n2\tHabla con Dwalin\tSigue a Dwalin para ver si puedes detener la resurrección.\n3\tHabla con Dwalin\tContinúa defendiendo a Dwalin mientras te acercas a tu objetivo: el lugar donde se realiza el ritual para restaurar a Skorgrím.\n4\tHabla con Dwalin\tTras huir de los salones, habla con Dwalin una vez más.\n",
[7128]="70028336\n1\tEntra en Plas-maru y busca la cámara principal\tBusca la cámara principal de Plas-maru.\n2\tusa las palancas para abrir la puerta (total: 3)\tAdéntrate en lo más profundo de Plas-maru y localiza las palancas que controlan la puerta de la cámara principal.\n3\tDescubre qué está causando que los espectros se agiten en el Valle de los Huesos\tEntra en la cámara principal de Plas-maru y descubre el secreto del túmulo.\n4\tDerrota a Mostun\tAhuyenta al espíritu maligno de Lhucu.\n5\tHabla con Lhucu\tHabla con Lhucu y escapa de Plas-maru.\n",
[7129]="7006B605\n1\tTalk to Silirtas outside Maurûsh\tSilirtas and Sigileth have come with you to investigate Maurûsh. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tExamine the abandoned possessions at the camp-fire\tThe Orcs remaining in Maurûsh seemingly abandoned much of their equipment at one of their camp-fires.\n3\tExamine Sigileth\tSigileth and Silirtas stand unmoving in Maurûsh. What has happened to them... or to you?\n4\tExamine Silirtas\tSigileth and Silirtas stand unmoving in Maurûsh. What has happened to them... or to you?\n5\tSearch deeper within Maurûsh for some way to free your friends\tSome evil located deeper within Maurûsh may hold the key to freeing Sigileth and Silirtas from the ensnaring enchantment.\n6\tExamine the imposing creature worshipped by the Orcs\tAn unusual creature, larger than the other Orcs you have seen, stands deep within Maurûsh. Or is this creature a product of the enchantment in which you have been snared?\n7\tWait for answers\tA great weight lifts from your eyelids.\n8\tTalk to Sigileth within Maurûsh\tSigileth stares at you with concern.\n9\tTalk to Mithrandir in Maurûsh\tMithrandir has come to Maurûsh... but for what purpose has the Wizard travelled so far south?\n10\tFlee down the slope to the south to escape from Maurûsh!\tSome great evil pursues you! You have to escape from Maurûsh!\n",
[7130]="70042DDF\n1\tTalk to Duilin on the path\030Talk to Derufin on the path\tYou have left Bâr Húrin with Duilin and Derufin to hunt one of the mighty Mûmakil.\n2\tChoose to accompany Duilin\030Choose to accompany Derufin\tDuilin and Derufin are waiting for you to choose which of the brothers you wish to accompany on the hunt for a Mûmak.\n3\tYou have made your way through the wilds of Ithilien in search of Mûmakil, and now the brothers Duilin and Derufin have once more crossed paths in their respective hunts.\t\n4\tSurvive the encounter, and ensure that Duilin and Derufin live to tell the tale\tYou have encountered two Mûmakil in the wilds of Ithilien, but Duilin and Derufin have lost the element of surprise and now the three of you must escape from the trumpeting beasts.\n",
[7131]="70018F13\n1\tHabla con Legolas.\tLegolas y Gimli están de pie en uno de los caminos que atraviesan los bosques de Lothlórien. Legolas espera viajar contigo a través de los bosques de Lothlórien. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n2\tHabla con el arquero Galadhrim.\tHas venido con Legolas y Gimli cerca de la frontera del bosque, y has sido saludado por uno de los Galadhrim.\n3\tSigue a Legolas y Gimli hasta la orilla del bosque.\tSe te ha dicho que sigas a Legolas y Gimli hasta la orilla del bosque para encontrarte con un enano que ha preguntado por ti.\n4\tHabla con Bósi.\tBósi está en la frontera de Lothlórien, intentando conseguir una audiencia con Celeborn.\n5\tHabla con el guardián Galadhrim.\tLos Galadhrim están esperando a escuchar qué tienes que decir sobre la solicitud de Bósi.\n6\tHabla con Bósi.\tMientras estaba vendado, Bósi ha sido llevado a Caras Galadhon dentro de Lothlórien para su audiencia con Celeborn.\n7\tVigila la audiencia de Bósi con Celeborn.\tBósi está teniendo una audiencia con Celeborn de Lórien sobre el envío de Elfos para asistir a los enanos en Khazad-dûm.\n8\tHabla con Galadriel\tGaladriel espera para hablar contigo tras la audiencia con Bósi.\n",
[7132]="70041A4C\n1\tTalk to Erchar\tErchar is standing outside Hata Kebir. You have arrived at Hata Kebir and should now speak to Erchar before beginning your assault.\n2\tFight your way into Hata Kebir with Erchar and Herion\tErchar and Herion can be found within Hata Kebir. You have begun to assault Hata Kebir with Garvir's brothers and should follow them into battle.\n3\tHorses can be found just inside the western entrance to Hata Kebir. Erchar has asked you to free the horses and spook them, so that they might cause further commotion within Hata Kebir.\t\n4\tFight your way further into Hata Kebir\tErchar and Herion can be found within Hata Kebir. Garvir's brothers are battling their way deeper into Hata Kebir. You should aid them.\n5\tTalk to Jajax in Hata Kebir\tJajax is standing outside the inner camp-sites of Hata Kebir. You have battled your way deep into Hata Kebir and have discovered Jajax amid the largely-emptied tents nearby. You should speak to him.\n6\tFight your way to Azgarzôr's tent\tAzgarzôr's tent is in the heart of Hata Kebir. Jajax has joined with you and Garvir's brothers to confront Azgarzôr. You should battle your way to his tent.\n7\tConfront and defeat Azgarzôr\tAzgarzôr is in Hata Kebir. You have found Azgarzôr, and must now defeat him.\n8\tTalk to Erchar\tErchar is standing in Hata Kebir. You have defeated Azgarzôr and avenged Garvir. You should speak to Erchar before leaving the camp.\n",
[7133]="70044AB9\n1\tHabla con Harnion\tTalk to Harnion about sparring with the soldiers.\n2\tGo to the centre of the sparring area.\t\n3\tSpar with the soldiers\tSpar with the soldiers until you've faced them all.\n4\tHabla con Harnion\tTalk to Harnion about the sparring match.\n",
[7134]="70061CA0\n1\tHabla con Halbarad en Dol Ernil\tHalbarad busca alguna pista sobre la desaparición de Meneldir y Gorwen.\n2\tBusca pistas en la sala del trono de Dol Ernil\tLas huellas se han vuelto aún más confusas en la sala del trono de Dol Ernil.\n3\tHabla con Halbarad en la sala del trono de Dol Ernil\tHalbarad se encuentra en la sala del trono de Dol Ernil, buscando alguna pista sobre el paradero de Gorwen y Meneldir.\n4\tUsa la trampilla en la esquina de la sala del trono para descender a las catacumbas\tLa trampilla en un rincón de la sala del trono conduce a unas catacumbas bajo la fortaleza.\n5\tLlega a las catacumbas bajo Dol Ernil\t¿Descendieron Meneldir y Gorwen a las catacumbas bajo Dol Ernil?\n6\tBusca a Meneldir y Gorwen en las catacumbas bajo Dol Ernil\t¿Descendieron Meneldir y Gorwen a las catacumbas bajo Dol Ernil?\n7\tHabla con Gorwen en las catacumbas bajo Dol Ernil\tAlgo anda mal en las catacumbas bajo Dol Ernil, y más de una vida está en peligro.\n8\tSobrevive a tu encuentro con el Miedo Gris\tUn mal terrible acecha en las catacumbas bajo Dol Ernil.\n9\tEscucha las últimas palabras de Meneldir\tMeneldir ha sufrido una herida grave. Le queda poco tiempo.\n",
[7135]="700613D9\n1\tHabla con Adamanda\tAdamanda te espera fuera de Nobotella. Habla con Adamanda Nortuk.\n2\tColoca la trampa\030Coloca el pastel\tEl sendero está en la Comarca Allende. Adamanda Nortuk te ha pedido que coloques una trampa a lo largo del sendero que usa frecuentemente el lince.\n3\tHabla con Diamante\tAdamanda te espera fuera de Nobotella. Habla con Adamanda Nortuk.\n4\tArrodíllate detrás del arbusto con Diamante\t\n5\tEspera que la trampa se despliegue\tEspera a que el lince sea capturado.\n6\tHabla con Adamanda\tTras descubrir que el lince era una madre reciente, Adamanda ha liberado a la criatura. \\Debes hablar con Adamanda.\n",
[7136]="7000A880\n1\tHabla con Tadan\tEl Montaraz Tadan y sus compañeros Dúnedain se ocultan en el extremo de la calzada hacia Haudh Elendil, aguardando en emboscada a que Mordrambor aparezca. Tadan necesita que atraigas a Mordrambor hacia la emboscada de los Dúnedain al final de la calzada.\n2\tEnfréntate a Mordrambor en el extremo más alejado de la calzada\tSe te ha pedido que lleves a Mordrambor de regreso al extremo de la calzada con los Montaraces.\n3\tHabla con Tadan\tEl Montaraz Tadan está al final de la calzada, frente a Haudh Elendil. Tadan te espera para hablar contigo tras la captura de Mordrambor.\n",
})
